    "text": "Board admins and board members can import.\nYou need a CSV or Excel (.xlsx) file with one row per home, up to 5 MB and 5,000 rows. Only the property address is required. The unit or lot number, city, state, ZIP, owner name, email and phone, mailing address and tenure are used when the file has them.\nMoving from CINC Systems? Export the homeowner list as Excel or CSV and upload it as it is. No file yet? Select Download the template on the import page and fill it in.",
