    "text": "Each new home can be billed the same as one added by hand: as soon as your HOA has an association. Homes imported before then are attached to it automatically when an admin sets it up. Its owners are recorded as its current owners and appear on its Residents tab. Homes appear on the Properties list as the import goes.",
