    "articleId": "start-board-admin",
    "sectionId": "overview",
    "heading": "Start here: setting up your HOA",
    "text": "HomeownerHub keeps your board's work in one place: homes and residents, dues, violations, architectural requests, meetings and mail. Its AI drafts letters and answers, but nothing is posted or sent until someone on the board approves it. Start with the setup checklist at the top of your dashboard.",
