    "sectionId": "overview",
    "heading": "Draft and print a collections letter",
    "text": "When a home's dues are past due, the board can draft a collections letter from the home's collections case. HomeownerHub builds the letter from the ledger and your state's rules, not with AI. A board member approves it in Approvals, then you print it or save it as a PDF and mail it yourself.",
