    "text": "The charge shows Paid, the home's balance goes down, and the payment posts to the ledger.\nIf your board turned on Email owners a receipt when we record their payment (in Resident payments), the home's owners get one email receipt. It's off until a board turns it on.\nTo send a receipt yourself (an owner asks \"did you get my check?\", or automatic receipts are off), select Send receipt on the charge's row in Dues, check the amount, date and home, then confirm with Send receipt. It receipts the most recent payment on that charge, whether or not automatic receipts are on.",
