    "sectionId": "steps",
    "heading": "Steps",
    "text": "Open Accounting, then Budgets, and open the budget. The checklist is at the top.\nSelect Schedule the adoption meeting. The agenda is filled in to say the budget and its assessments will be considered. Pick the date and select Schedule meeting. The meeting is linked to the budget. If the meeting is already scheduled, pick it from the list and select Link meeting.\nSelect Write the meeting notice. New message opens with the meeting notice filled in from the agenda. Check it and send it the usual way. In Florida, tick Special assessments will be considered at this meeting if they will be.\nAfter the board votes, select Approve on the budget.\nUnder Record the adoption, enter the date the board adopted it and select Record adoption.\nSelect Prepare owner budget notice to send owners the budget. When it has gone out, enter the date and select Mark as sent.\nSelect Bill dues to bill next year's dues at the new amount.",
