    "sectionId": "steps",
    "heading": "Steps",
    "text": "Open Accounting, then the Invoices tab, and select Enter bill.\nTo let the AI read it, select Choose a bill under Scan a bill and pick a PDF or a photo of the bill. Then select Review in Approvals and approve it there (see below). If the vendor emailed the bill to the HOA mailbox, open the email in Messages and select Scan as a bill on the PDF or photo, then Scan bill instead. Its card in Approvals has Open the email it came from.\nTo enter it by hand instead, fill in Vendor, Invoice number, Amount, Invoice date and Expense account. Due date and Memo are optional.\nSelect Enter bill. The bill's page opens.\nWhen you pay the vendor, open the bill from Invoices. Under Record payment, choose how you paid in Paid by (check, ACH, card, cash or other).\nOptional: type the check number or confirmation code in Reference.\nSelect Mark paid. The button shows the full amount of the bill.",
