    "heading": "The monthly board report email",
    "text": "The app emails every board member a short report on the 1st of each month. It covers last month's cash, reserves, collections, overdue dues, income and expenses, budget, violations, architectural requests, what's waiting on the board and the next meeting. You don't have to do anything for it to go out.",
