    "text": "\"Couldn’t load the reserve fund\": only the card failed. Refresh the page. It never shows $0 in place of a failed number.\nSet up a reserve fund still shows after opening the books: the association may already have a fund coded RESERVE that is inactive, or not of the reserve type. Contact support.",
