    "text": "The request closes and moves to the end of the list as Fulfilled. Your note is saved as a private board note on the request.\nThe owner is not emailed when you mark a request fulfilled. Tell them in the conversation first.\nEvery morning, the daily email tells board members how many records requests are past their deadline or due within 3 days, with a link to this page.",
