    "sectionId": "overview",
    "heading": "Register your Georgia association with the Secretary of State",
    "text": "The Georgia registration kit helps the board register the association with the Georgia Secretary of State, as SB 406 requires from Jan 1, 2027. It also keeps the board's record of each filing.",
