    "heading": "Before you start",
    "text": "Only board members and admins see the kit. It's for Georgia associations.\nUpload your declaration, bylaws and rules under Documents, so the checklist can find them.\nHave your corporate records to hand, for the mailing address, the registered agent and the officers' titles.",
