    "text": "Open Compliance in the sidebar, then select Open the registration kit on the registration row.\nUnder Decide: register, or opt out, read the statute text, then select We will register or We opted out in writing.\nUnder What the filing needs, check the name, officers and number of units HomeownerHub filled in. Type the mailing address and registered agent, then select Save to the sheet.\nTick off the governing documents, and run the balance sheet and income statement from the links.\nSelect Print / Save as PDF to print the checklist and fill-in sheet. Write in the officers' titles by hand.\nFile with the Secretary of State.\nUnder Record the filing, enter the day you filed and the confirmation number, then select Record the registration. Each year, record the renewal the same way.",
