    "text": "\"The filing day can’t be in the future.\": enter the day you actually filed.\n\"Use letters, numbers, spaces and - / . # only\": type the confirmation number as it appears on the receipt.\n\"The stored record can’t be verified\": something changed the record outside HomeownerHub. Record your filings again. Until then the association counts as not registered.\n\"Couldn’t load the board roster\" or \"Couldn’t load your documents\": a loading problem. Fill those lines in by hand, or refresh the page.",
