    "text": "Open Insurance in the sidebar.\nSelect Add a policy.\nPick the kind of policy, for example Master / property, General liability, Directors & officers (D&O) or Fidelity / crime bond.\nEnter the insurance company and the date the policy ends. Add the policy number, limit, deductible, premium and start date if you have them.\nUnder Policy document, pick the PDF you uploaded, if any.\nSelect Save policy.",
