    "text": "A rules answer lists the sections of your community's documents it used, under the answer.\nIf the documents don't answer your question, the assistant says so and offers Ask the board.\nAsk the board opens a new support request with your question filled in. Start an ARC application opens the ARC form with your question filled in. The form says Suggested by the assistant — review before sending. Check the form, change anything, then send it yourself.",
